# headwear/cloth/conical: the Conical straw hat (OUTER, P2b wave 2; the Jade coast's and the rice fields'): a wide shallow cone
# of woven straw (cloth3: straw whatever the person wears) with radial weave lines, the brim's near edge curving low over
# the brow; 20 px across, so the LOCO atlas stays inside B10's 128 KB. Seen from the high camera it is the same cone from
# every side (the light stays top-left). Mask: the 20 px brim.
# Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
body adult
role headwear conical
layer headwear
anchor head
keys hatpose
legend Q cloth3 0
legend R cloth3 1
legend S cloth3 2
legend T cloth3 3
legend U cloth3 4

# (P5b SIG FR1) begin jade-kasa: the Jade T2 great kasa: a broad shallow cone of plaited straw, the vermilion binding and chin cord
legend ! plume 0
legend $ plume 1
legend % plume 2
legend & plume 3
legend * plume 4
legend + leather 0
legend , leather 1
legend / leather 2
legend : leather 3
legend ; leather 4
view D key rest origin 2 3 when sighelm-jade,helm.t2,!helm.t3 replace
